# Agentic Test Review

## Instructions

Review the structured test docstring and assertions under `## Test Content`.
Update every row in `## Review Scorecard` according to the criteria under `## Review Criteria`.
Set each result to `pass` or `fail`, and provide concrete notes for every failure.

Evaluate each criterion in a fresh subagent. Pass only this Markdown file as the review packet.
Do not inspect repository files, manifests, outer unit tests, prior conversation, or expected assertions.
If context is missing from this file, fail with notes asking the test to include it.

